      "template": "ButtonGroup.tsx",
      "storyTitle": "Components/ButtonGroup",
      "doc": "API: `<ButtonGroup color=\"gray|white\" size vertical label>` + `<ButtonGroupItem active iconOnly>`.\nA joined row of Buttons: Figma \"Gray\" = **Secondary** buttons, \"White\" = **Tertiary** buttons, same size scale; items overlap by 1px (`-space-x-px`), first `rounded-e-none`, last `rounded-s-none`, middle `rounded-none`; the group carries `shadow-xs` (items `shadow-none`). The selected item uses the Tertiary Hover style (`bg-neutral-secondary-medium text-heading`). Vertical: `flex-col -space-y-px`, ends `rounded-b-none`/`rounded-t-none`. Example types: icon buttons (36px, `text-body`, active `text-heading`), Plus & minus, Numbers (pager), With dropdown button, With badge, Start CTA, Icon button + Info.\n**Use** for 2–5 closely related actions or a compact view switcher. **Don't** for unrelated actions, primary CTAs, or >5 options. If it switches content panels, use `Tabs variant=\"segmented\"` for ARIA.\nA11y: the wrapper is `role=\"group\"` with an `aria-label`; toggle groups set `aria-pressed` on each button; icon-only items need an `aria-label`.",
