      "template": "Pagination.tsx",
      "storyTitle": "Components/Pagination",
      "doc": "API: `<Pagination page pageCount onPageChange variant=\"default|arrows|two-buttons\" helper>`.\nBuilt entirely from Buttons: a joined row of **Tertiary `sm`** buttons (`-space-x-px`, outer ends `rounded-base`, inner `rounded-none`, group `shadow-xs`); page numbers are 36px squares; the **current page uses the selected style** (`bg-brand-softer border-brand-subtle text-fg-brand`, unchanged on hover) + `aria-current=\"page\"`, so it never looks like a hovered page; prev/next icon buttons (`text-heading`/`text-body`). Two buttons: separate Tertiary `sm` buttons `gap-3`. With dropdown / Dropdown & buttons: Secondary `sm` \"Rows per page\" select. With input / Simple with input: `Input sm` + `text-sm font-medium leading-none text-body` (\"of 20\") + Brand `sm` \"Go\". Helper text: \"Showing **1–10** of **100**\" `text-sm text-body`, numbers `font-semibold text-heading`.\n**Use** for large ordered datasets. **Don't** for feeds (infinite scroll / Load more) or a single page. Use Arrows/Two buttons when the total is unknown.\nA11y: a `<nav>` with an `aria-label`; the current page has `aria-current=\"page\"`; previous and next icon buttons have `aria-label`s.",
