      "template": "Carousel.tsx",
      "storyTitle": "Components/Carousel",
      "doc": "API: `<Carousel label variant=\"slides|cards\" controls indicators>{slides}</Carousel>`.\nViewport `relative overflow-hidden rounded-base` (placeholder `bg-gray`); controls `size-11 rounded-full bg-overlay-light text-white` with `size-7` icons, `px-8` from the edges; indicators `size-3.5 rounded-full bg-overlay-light`, active `bg-white`. Card carousels: Cards `gap-8`, bottom controls as 40px white-icon buttons.\n**Use** sparingly for galleries of equivalent visual items or testimonials. **Don't** hide important content in later slides, auto-advance without pause, or use as the key hero message.\nA11y: a group with `aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"`; previous, next and indicator buttons have `aria-label`s and the active indicator has `aria-current`; slide changes are announced through `aria-live`; never autoplay without a pause control.",
